  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Using JSON_DELETE will <b>not</b> prune empty objects or arrays at higher levels.</li>
    <li>Using JSON_DELETE to delete a non-existent array or object element in a JSON string will return <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/JSON_INVALID" target="_blank">JSON_INVALID</a>, not an unaltered string.</li>
  </ul>
